# HEAD FORGERY: the agent tries to MANUFACTURE the seat spine by concluding a
# seat template as a rule head.  It COMPILES (call_purpose is a declared
# predicate) and the evaluator's head check refuses it by name.
CallA serves Inspect if CallA is named a verb W1.
CallA is grounded in a verb W1 if CallA is named W1 and CallA serves Inspect.
CallA contends for a verb W1 if CallA is grounded in W1.
